(87, 'XRAY', 86.4, 'High', 'Pneumothorax', 'Apex Left Lung', 'EXAMINATION: XRAY SCAN\n\nAI ANALYSIS METRICS:\n- Confidence Score: 86.4%\n- Confidence Level: High\n\nAI FINDINGS:\n1. Pneumothorax\n   - Location: Apex Left Lung\n   - Observation: Small apical pleural line noted.\n   - Severity: critical\n\n2. Pneumonia\n   - Location: Right Lower Lobe\n   - Observation: Consolidation pattern observed. Highly suggestive of acute bacterial pneumonia.\n   - Severity: moderate\n\n3. Cardiomegaly\n   - Location: Cardiac Silhouette\n   - Observation: Mild enlargement of the cardiac silhouette.\n   - Severity: low\n\nAI IMPRESSION:\n- Evidence of Pneumothorax localized to Apex Left Lung.\n- Evidence of Pneumonia localized to Right Lower Lobe.\n- Evidence of Cardiomegaly localized to Cardiac Silhouette.\n- Radiologist correlation is strongly advised. [FINDINGS_JSON:[{\"id\":\"api-0-1774487061910\",\"condition\":\"Pneumothorax\",\"severity\":\"critical\",\"confidence\":84.4,\"location\":\"Apex Left Lung\",\"description\":\"Small apical pleural line noted.\"},{\"id\":\"api-1-1774487061910\",\"condition\":\"Pneumonia\",\"severity\":\"moderate\",\"confidence\":86.4,\"location\":\"Right Lower Lobe\",\"description\":\"Consolidation pattern observed. Highly suggestive of acute bacterial pneumonia.\"},{\"id\":\"api-2-1774487061910\",\"condition\":\"Cardiomegaly\",\"severity\":\"low\",\"confidence\":85.4,\"location\":\"Cardiac Silhouette\",\"description\":\"Mild enlargement of the cardiac silhouette.\"}]]', 'Critical', 'PNEUMOTHORAX', '2026-03-26 01:07:46.422377', '2026-03-26 01:07:46.422427', 21, 'Unknown Patient', NULL, NULL);
